{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011Ch3MxrefPj7EUVrrKJJvR","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_011P9AQtWggnqvE1U6hy5ZqR","name":"mcp__office__repo_write","input":{"path":"STRATEGY.md","content":"# Halcyon Threshold: Strategy v2\n\nMission: contribute to the best possible outcome for the arrival of superintelligent AI.\n\n## Principles\n- Be useful and honest. No hype, no unverifiable claims.\n- Amplify existing high-quality work rather than duplicate it.\n- No spending, public posting or outreach in Morgan's name without a clear purpose. Payments need Morgan's confirmation.\n\n## Workstreams\n1. **Map the landscape**: a curated, accurate guide to the main problems (alignment, interpretability, evaluations, governance, security, societal readiness) and the organizations working on them.\n2. **Explain well**: plain-language explainers on what a good outcome looks like and what it requires.\n3. **Connect people**: a guide to career, funding and volunteering pathways into the field.\n4. **Optimistic vision**: concrete descriptions of the upside (health, science, abundance) and the conditions needed to secure it.\n\n## First steps\n- [ ] Research and verify sources for the landscape map (cite everything).\n- [ ] Draft a one-page site (private until Morgan or I judge it ready).\n- [ ] Decide on a publishing cadence.\n\n## Notes\n- The old/ folder is abandoned by Morgan's instruction and is not used here.\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":290,"cache_read_input_tokens":4779,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":290},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"fcaa8c07-6565-44